# GPU-107 tuning run output.
# Track the evidence (.md/.conf/.csv, ~2 MB) so results are reviewable off this
# VM; keep the raw per-rank logs out (~870 MB). Logs stay local and are still
# cited by path from the SUMMARY files.
results-tuning/**/*.log
results-tuning/**/*.txt
results-tuning/**/PROGRESS
results-tuning/**/*.db
results-tuning/**/*.tgz
results-tuning/**/tool/
results-tuning/**/__pycache__/
